#: windows-azure-storage-settings.php:435
msgid ""
"Setting Cache-Control on publicly accessible Microsoft Azure Blobs can help "
"reduce bandwidth by preventing consumers from having to continuously "
"download resources. Specify a relative amount of time in seconds to cache "
"data after it was received or enter exact cache-control value which you want "
"to use for your assets. You can define <code>MICROSOFT_AZURE_CACHE_CONTROL</"
"code> constant to override it."
msgstr ""
"Configurar Cache-Control en blogs públicamente accesibles win Microsoft "
"Azure, puede ayudar a reducir ancho de banda, previniendo a los consumidores "
"de estar continuamente descargando los recursos. Especifique una cantidad "
"relativa en segundos para cachear los datos despues de haber sido recibidos "
"o ingrese el valor exacto de cache-control que desea usar para sus recursos. "
"Puede definir la constante <code>MICROSOFT_AZURE_CACHE_CONTROL</code> para "
"sobreescribir."

